# Copy to .env.local. Until SUPABASE_URL is set the app runs on the in-memory
# mock repository (src/lib/mock/seed.ts).

# ── Supabase ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOTE THE MISSING NEXT_PUBLIC_ PREFIX. It is deliberate and it is the whole
# architecture of this app.
#
# Myanmar ISPs block *.supabase.co. A browser client would therefore fail for
# the actual customers - the shop staff - while working perfectly on any
# machine you test from, which is the worst possible failure shape. So every
# Supabase call is made from the server (server components, server actions,
# route handlers) and the browser only ever talks to our own origin, which
# proxies onward. Prefixing either of these with NEXT_PUBLIC_ would ship the
# value to the browser and quietly re-open that hole.
#
# These come from the FUTSAL project (mmyjtvlnuizpwktpkuij) - the shared one
# that holds auth.users, public.app_access and the `game` schema. Not from the
# old standalone game project.
SUPABASE_URL=https://mmyjtvlnuizpwktpkuij.supabase.co

# Publishable key (sb_publishable_...). Used for requests made on behalf of a
# signed-in user; RLS still applies.
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Secret key (sb_secret_...). Bypasses RLS entirely. Only for creating staff
# accounts. Never log it, never send it to the browser.
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=

# Toggle the data source: "mock" (default) or "supabase".
DATA_SOURCE=mock

# ── Zone ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Set once the shop is mounted as a zone under the futsal origin, so Server
# Actions pass the Origin/Host CSRF check behind the rewrite.
# ZONE_SELF_HOST=

# ── Cloudinary (game cover uploads on the Games screen) ─────────────────────
# Same account as the futsal site's news images. Server-only: no NEXT_PUBLIC_.
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=

# ── Park site refresh (Games screen -> hub /games) ──────────────────────────
# After a save on the Games screen, this app pings the hub so the park's
# /games page shows the change at once instead of after its 60 s cache.
# HUB_ORIGIN is the hub's public origin; PARK_REVALIDATE_SECRET must be the
# same long random string on BOTH Vercel projects. Unset = no ping (the page
# still catches up within a minute).
HUB_ORIGIN=https://myathida-futsal.vercel.app
PARK_REVALIDATE_SECRET=
